invariant: INV-33
file: handshake_auth.c
catches: webpki_loop_record
reason: pins alone offer X.509 beside the raw key, and the Certificate
  step still refuses every chain under them with unsupported_certificate,
  the rule before docs/decisions.md 65. A server that sends a chain,
  which this tree's server always does, never connects. bin/webpki_loop_record's
  leaf-pin rows against that server object.

--- old
        return webpki_verify_leaf_pin(list, list_len, cfg, &h->leaf, &h->alert);
--- new
        h->alert = ALERT_UNSUPPORTED_CERTIFICATE;
        return CH_EAUTH;
